# Byte-exact checkout for golden-test fixtures. The golden harness reads
# .cfg/.marks/.golden files as raw bytes and compares parse positions, so a
# CRLF checkout (git's core.autocrlf default on Windows) shifts tree-sitter
# error ranges and fails every comparison. Force LF everywhere.
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.marks text eol=lf
*.golden text eol=lf
